<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="index.php">Raw materials</a> / Add material</div><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">UC-M01 / EMPLOYEE DEMONSTRATION</span><h1>Add raw material</h1><p>Create a record for a material used to build skis.</p></div></div><div id="page-error" class="notice error" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="form-layout" id="editor-layout"><form id="material-form" class="panel" data-mode="create" novalidate><div id="form-errors" class="notice error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div><fieldset><legend>Material information</legend><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="name">Material name <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="name" name="name" required maxlength="80" aria-describedby="name-error"><span class="field-error" id="name-error"></span></div><div class="field full"><label for="description">Description <span class="required">(optional)</span></label><input id="description" name="description" maxlength="255" aria-describedby="description-error"><span class="field-error" id="description-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="unit">Unit of measure <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="unit" name="unit" required aria-describedby="unit-help unit-error"><option value="">Select a unit</option><option value="sq m">sq m (square meters)</option><option value="m">m (meters)</option><option value="kg">kg (kilograms)</option><option value="L">L (liters)</option><option value="each">each (individual pieces)</option></select><small id="unit-help">Quantities, costs, and reorder levels all use this unit.</small><span class="field-error" id="unit-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="unitCost">Unit cost in USD <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="unitCost" name="unitCost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="unitCost-help unitCost-error"><small id="unitCost-help">Cost per one unit. Internal information.</small><span class="field-error" id="unitCost-error"></span></div></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Starting inventory</legend><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="quantity">Starting quantity on hand <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="quantity-help quantity-error"><small id="quantity-help">Enter 0 if nothing has been received yet.</small><span class="field-error" id="quantity-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="reorderLevel">Reorder level <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="reorderLevel" name="reorderLevel" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="reorderLevel-help reorderLevel-error"><small id="reorderLevel-help">A low-stock indicator appears at or below this amount.</small><span class="field-error" id="reorderLevel-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="lastPurchase">Most recent purchase date <span class="required">(optional)</span></label><input id="lastPurchase" name="lastPurchase" type="date" aria-describedby="lastPurchase-error"><span class="field-error" id="lastPurchase-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="employee">Recorded by <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="employee" name="employee" required aria-describedby="employee-error"><option value="">Select an employee</option><option value="E01">E01 · Alex Morgan</option><option value="E02">E02 · Sam Rivera</option></select><span class="field-error" id="employee-error"></span></div><div class="field full"><label for="status">Material status <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="status" name="status" required aria-describedby="status-error"><option>Active</option><option>Inactive</option></select><span class="field-error" id="status-error"></span></div></div></fieldset><div class="form-footer"><button class="primary" type="submit">Add material</button><a class="btn" id="cancel-form" href="index.php">Cancel</a><small>Temporary demo changes only</small></div></form><aside class="panel aside"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU SAVE</span><h2>Keep production supplied</h2><ul><li>Material IDs are assigned automatically and cannot be edited.</li><li>Every material needs a unit of measure.</li><li>Costs, quantities, and reorder levels cannot be negative.</li><li>Material names must be unique to avoid duplicate records.</li><li>After creation, stock changes only through a recorded adjustment.</li></ul><p class="notice">This prototype updates sample data in this tab. It does not write to a database.</p></aside></div></main>
